    /// What playing the playlist plays, first to last.
    ///
    /// Every movie, episode or song the entries stand for, in entry order.
    /// A single item stands for itself. A show expands to its episodes by
    /// season number, specials (season 0) last as Up next orders them,
    /// then episode number; a
    /// season to its episodes by episode number; a collection to its
    /// movies the profile may see, as listCollectionMovies orders them; an
    /// album to its songs by
