    /// Shares the playlist with everyone in one household. Only its owner shares it.
    ///
    /// The owner shares with a household they are in, their own or one
    /// they were shared into. It reaches whoever is in the household at
    /// the time: someone who joins later sees it, someone who leaves no
    /// longer does. A kid in it only reads, whatever the access. A
    /// profile reached by several shares gets the strongest. Any other
