    /// The stations the active profile may see, by name, each with what is on.
    ///
    /// A station is continuous programming, in the manner of a broadcast
    /// channel, from exactly one playlist of its owner, whose kind it
    /// takes: movies, tv or music. The server alone decides its order and
    /// what is on; nobody pauses or seeks a station, and tuning in joins
    /// what is on at its live position.
    ///
    /// A private station is seen by its owner only; a household one by
    /// every profile of the owner's household; a server one by every
