    /// Claims one title's file for the profile on this device.
    ///
    /// The item is a movie, episode, song or YouTube video the profile may
    /// see; its file is decided as resolveDownloads decides it, with
    /// audioTrackId or else the default audio track. The file itself is
    /// ready at once. A conversion is queued: the client polls getDownload
    /// every few seconds until status is ready, then fetches url, or
    /// fetches the file with wait=1 at once, as Download describes. Asked
    /// again for the same file, the answer is the same download.
    ///
    /// Conversions are made one at a time, and only while no live video
    /// transcode is encoding: one running pauses for live playback, and
    /// none takes a live transcode slot. The devices with conversions
    /// queued take turns, the one served longest ago first, each served in
    /// the order it claimed; a conversion several devices claim is a turn
    /// for each. A conversion that failed is status failed with an error;
    /// asking again queues it again. One a restart interrupted starts
    /// again.
    ///
    /// A download goes 3 days after it was made or its conversion finished,
    /// whichever is later, or when deleted; its conversion goes when no
